97 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Welcome to our ministry team training for recruitment. Volunteers are the backbone of our ministry, playing a vital role in transmitting the love and message of Jesus to people. Their dedication, time, and talents are invaluable, and as leaders, it is our responsibility to honor, love, and value our volunteers. This training will equip you with the knowledge and skills needed to recruit, onboard, retain, and appreciate our volunteers effectively, ensuring a thriving and engaged ministry workforce.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A leader can only lead if someone is following them. The immediate hurdle that you, as a leader, must overcome is threefold.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
99 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (First, acknowledge your role as a leader. What defines a leader? A leader is someone who inspires and directs others toward a shared objective. True leadership isn't about gathering followers to be served; it's about gathering individuals whom you can serve for a higher cause.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
