147 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Phil had been attending Garden City Church for a few months when he was approached by a hurried leader in the hallway one Sunday morning. "Hey Phil, we need someone to help with the children's ministry. Can you start next week?" Feeling put on the spot, Phil reluctantly agreed. However, he received no training, had no clear understanding of his role, and quickly became overwhelmed. Within a month, he stopped volunteering altogether and felt disconnected from the church.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
148 0 obj
<<
