/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In contrast, Stacey, another new attender, was invited to coffee by a ministry leader. They had a meaningful conversation about Stacey's interests, skills, and her desire to serve. The leader shared the vision and mission of the children's ministry and explained the training and support available. Stacey felt valued and excited to contribute. She received proper training, was gradually introduced to her role, and soon became a passionate and dedicated volunteer, thriving in her service and building strong relationships within the church.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
